  answer: Lester Flatt
  acceptedAnswers:
  - Lester Flatt
  hints:
  - "Su cat\xE1logo registrado incluye \xABThe Storms Are On the Ocean (with Mother
    Maybelle Carter)\xBB, de 1935, y llega hasta 1982."
  - "Se mueve dentro de country; \xABI'll Never Love Another\xBB refleja una energ\xEDa
    media y un pulso cercano a 121 BPM."
  - "Entre sus grabaciones figuran \xABThe Wreck of the Old 97 (with The Foggy Mountain
    Boys)\xBB y \xABDon't Get Above Your Raising (with The Foggy Mountain Boys)\xBB."
  - "Tambi\xE9n lanz\xF3 \xABThe Ballad of Jed Clampett\xBB."
  - "Es el proyecto musical detr\xE1s de \xABFoggy Mountain Breakdown - Theme From
    \"Bonnie & Clyde\"\xBB y \xABFoggy Mountain Top (with Mother Maybelle Carter)\xBB."
